Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:03.39,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:06.42,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You need to pass an exam to raise your rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:09.07,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And before that, you need to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:13.66,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And so you'll need to take jobs yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:19.75,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But if they know Rentt Faina is \Nback in town, the guild will...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:25.41,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, why not register as an \Nadventurer under another name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:29.22,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't do that! Using two different \Nnames is against the guild rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:31.87,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:34.98,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And even if they do find out, \Nit won't be a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:37.84,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Everyone knows Rentt Faina, and they'd have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.92,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,no end of questions about \Nhow you ended up that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:45.39,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But nobody will ask questions \Nabout a wandering adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:48.05,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,no matter how strange they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.01,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:53.85,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, you'll lose what \Naccomplishments Rentt Faina had,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:58.85,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,and you'll have to start over from Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.47,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.70,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,My goal is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.11,0:01:06.97,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,to become a Mythril-class \Nadventurer someday. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:43.18,Title,{Episode 6,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\pos(203.121,276.502)\b1} Bronze-class\NExam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:44.18,Main - Top,Sheila,0,0,0,,You already defeated three orcs?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Confirm, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:52.52,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,For a solo adventurer like me, \Na magic bag is a necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:56.13,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It took me five years to save up the \Nmoney for it, but it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:03:01.39,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They've been dressed properly \Nand are well-preserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:04.72,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'm sure the client will be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:07.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So the job's complete, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:08.38,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:10.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:14.30,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Um, can you wait a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:20.31,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:21.93,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,He took down three orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.06,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,Who is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.62,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,I've never seen him around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:30.30,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess as a rookie Iron-class, \NI stood out too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.76,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:34.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:37.05,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I just spoke to my manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:41.00,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, why don't you try \Ntaking the promotion exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:42.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Promotion exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:46.22,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes, the promotion exam for Bronze-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:49.37,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's rare for somebody to get the \Nopportunity so soon after registering,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.78,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,but you seem to have the potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.54,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So, you've already been asked to \Ntake the promotion exam for Bronze?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:04.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, it makes sense, with your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's partially thanks to this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:10.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes, but that just means you're \Ncapable of using its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:14.39,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So, what name did you register \Nunder at the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rentt Vivie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.86,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Why Vivie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:33.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you use my family name when \Neveryone knows I was close to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:34.58,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,people will be suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:38.79,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be fair to you to have \Npeople thinking you had a weird man
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:40.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,coming and going from your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So I decided I'd be your relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:49.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can understand that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:53.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But you don't need to worry \Nabout my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:59.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm just a broke academic who came here \N'cause she couldn't make it in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.40,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I don't care what people think about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You've done a lot for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:09.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You've done a lot for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:15.99,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The cooking, washing, cleaning... \Nyou do almost all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:19.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I owe you more than you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:21.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:26.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm still human because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:28.90,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:33.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then you can just stay \Nhere as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:37.10,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're my relative, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with imposing on family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:44.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.37,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Um, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:59.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt Vivie. I'm here for the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:01.38,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, you're him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.97,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Huh? Rentt? I didn't think \Nyou'd be coming today...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:08.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I got approved to take the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:12.97,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes, but I assumed you'd wait for the \Nnext one so you had time to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:15.62,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The next one is several months from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:16.72,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:21.05,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Whew, I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:23.30,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,He'll lose points for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:26.70,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer who can't show \Nup on time isn't trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:30.39,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Okay, Iron-class adventurers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:33.66,Main,Man,0,0,0,,We're about to begin the Bronze-class exam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:35.79,Main,Man,0,0,0,,First, the knowledge test!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:39.21,Main,Man,0,0,0,,We'll test you on guild rules and the \Nproper handling of monster drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:43.81,Main,Man,0,0,0,,You'll have to prove you're \Nready to be Bronze-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:48.25,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Only those who pass this exam will be \Nallowed to take the practical portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.51,0:06:50.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The practical changes each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:54.22,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,When I did it, it was gathering herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:57.98,Main,Man,0,0,0,,All right, anyone who's taking the \Nwritten exam, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.17,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:04.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.58,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There are more people here than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.28,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Isn't that girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:25.83,Flashback,Ryze,0,0,0,,Laura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:26.61,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:34.54,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I suppose her partner's taking the oral exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:38.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's rare for normal people \Nto be able to read and write.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:43.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I learned a lot of things in my village \Ngrowing up, like reading, writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:45.20,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and knowledge of herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:49.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Because I thought I'd need \Nthose to become an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:52.79,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So this exam will be easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.23,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's my second time taking it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.90,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,Sheesh, why was it so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.29,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,Don't let it get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.43,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.23,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I heard you got a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:07.93,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,That's extremely rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.24,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:12.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What will I be doing in the practical?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:17.17,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You'll form a party with a few of the \Nothers and carry out a job for the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.65,0:08:20.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A job for the guild, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.21,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Ryze! Laura!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:30.41,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You three will be forming a party today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I'm Ryze Danner, a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:41.15,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I use spirit energy to raise \Nmy strength when I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.74,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Let me fight in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:44.61,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm Laura Sati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:47.65,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm a mage, and I can use healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.48,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'll do my best at the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.96,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt Vivie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:58.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I fight with a sword, too. I can \Nuse magic and spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.98,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Okay, listen up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:05.68,Main,Man,0,0,0,,The practical exam involves completing \Na job prepared by the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.07,Main,Man,0,0,0,,It will take place at the \NLabyrinth of the New Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:10.66,Main,Man,0,0,0,,I will now hand out maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:14.71,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Your job is to reach the \Npoint written on your map.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.27,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,What, so we just have to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.65,Main,Man,0,0,0,,You have until sunset!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.95,0:09:22.21,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:25.46,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Um, are there any restrictions?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.92,Main,Man,0,0,0,,None in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.89,Main,Man,0,0,0,,You can do anything you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:31.52,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Are we all headed for the same spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:34.54,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Yes. You're all going to a single location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:40.41,Main,Man,0,0,0,,The first party to arrive will receive \Na reward befitting their efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:44.59,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,So it's a race, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:46.97,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It's a race...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:48.55,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:06.50,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Rentt, you ever been to the \NLabyrinth of the New Moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:07.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:09.82,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I see. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.92,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Just partway through \Nthe first floor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:14.51,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,That still counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:17.92,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I'll be Bronze-class soon, and \Nthen I'll go further down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.52,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:20.22,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.73,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,What do you want, Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We should buy a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:29.61,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We can't use the map we were given?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This map is 15 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:38.45,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,This old map won't be very reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.75,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Damn it! They tried to trick us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:43.66,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Hey! Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:48.80,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:52.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd like to buy a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:56.31,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,A map. Of course. That'll be two silvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.39,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,That's expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.79,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We can't afford that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We just need one for the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That shouldn't cost more \Nthan five bronze pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.36,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,You've got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:10.43,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,No fooling you, huh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:15.20,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Is that map really right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:18.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Compare it to the one you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.20,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.22,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,This part had a cave-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:25.40,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,The path changed at this part, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:30.67,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,And look! This map has the \Nlocation of all the traps, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:32.67,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We won't get lost now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:33.80,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.81,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,If you want to pass, \Nkiddos, do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.44,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Not bad, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:47.26,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But why would the guild give us bad maps?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:54.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Those carriages could've just as \Neasily taken us to the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer can never \Nlet their guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:04.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The point of this exam is to see if you've \Ngot what it takes to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:05.32,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:08.20,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Seriously? What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:11.04,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:15.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The guild can be surprisingly mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down because \Nthey're just skeletons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.14,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:43.98,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Thanks, Laura!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:44.62,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:13:00.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're pretty good for their age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:02.45,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're working together as a team,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:05.59,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and they've each got well-defined roles so \Nthat neither's doing too much for the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:12.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are you both okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:18.31,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me... \Nis what I'd like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:22.40,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Were there always this many \Nmonsters around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:26.81,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:29.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The monsters are being lured here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:31.29,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. You use things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:37.80,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.78,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,What's this doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:44.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You'll know soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:48.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Also, there's an ambush up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:53.06,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But none of the monsters here should \Nhave that level of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.03,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:01.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's right. The ones laying \Nthe ambush are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.55,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:06.26,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We have to fight humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:27.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Watch out! There are two more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:30.68,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I told you, I'll take the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:33.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll let you handle him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.57,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:40.15,Italics,Ryze,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.44,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:08.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Thanks, Laura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.13,0:15:09.59,Main,Ambusher,0,0,0,,Damn it! I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.19,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,This is payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Looks like they don't need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:20.81,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:22.85,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:32.25,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,W-We got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:33.78,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:44.18,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They're taking the exam too, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:45.72,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Why would they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:48.33,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,They wanted to make us fail the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:51.73,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,The examiner did say you could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.73,0:15:53.02,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Right, Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Anything can happen in the Labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The monsters aren't the only threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:00.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now you understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:03.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer can never \Nlet their guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:07.48,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,From now on, we'll obey your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.35,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:18.83,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Let's keep an eye out as we move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.79,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Come pick them up quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:38.90,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,He saw me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:42.02,Main,Ambusher,0,0,0,,Hey, untie me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:43.86,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:50.60,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,The man in the mask seemed to \Nknow you were sent by the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:51.67,Main,Ambusher,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:52.95,Main,Ambusher,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:53.96,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:57.59,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,Though I can think of one \Nperson it might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.80,Main,Cloaked Man,0,0,0,,Maybe my sister was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:10.47,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Is there something I can \Ndo for you, Guildmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:15.75,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Relax. Being all formal in front \Nof me won't earn you a raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:17.65,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:22.26,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,I heard a strange rumor about the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:25.39,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Rentt Vivie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.04,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,The new adventurer you're in charge of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:31.15,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Has he done something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:34.44,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Some people are saying he's the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:39.82,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,He showed up out of nowhere \Nin Maalt. He's quite skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.34,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,And we don't know anything about his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:45.70,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,If you want to say that's \Nsuspicious, I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:49.24,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,But every adventurer has \Nsomething in their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:52.32,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can just \Nignore the accusation, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:57.38,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,If you learn anything, \Ntell me immediately. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:17:59.73,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:09.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Our destination's just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:14.07,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,This door... it's what I think it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.18,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:18.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's one of several boss \Nrooms on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:23.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's no way to get to our destination \Nexcept by going through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:27.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You ever fought a boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.53,0:18:28.86,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:31.18,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,It's not something two \NIron-classes can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:32.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.80,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:41.02,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's no shame for an adventurer \Nin avoiding a fight you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:48.31,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,What, we're not the first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:51.26,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,They think they can beat \Nus to the goal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Other examinees?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:54.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.33,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Good timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:01.42,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,A party with two kids and \Na weirdo in a mask. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:05.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We're both taking the same exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate being talked to that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.57,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,What, you're lecturing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:11.32,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:14.54,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Hey, that girl's actually pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.50,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Hey, want to come with us instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.21,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Don't you dare speak to Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:22.30,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Who are you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:25.12,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Don't get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:26.25,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:30.97,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,H-Hey, it was a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:35.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't have \Nmuch of a sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:37.24,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:39.00,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,We're not going to try to stop \Nyou from going in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:39.58,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:40.70,Main,All,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:43.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can go in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:46.42,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We're going to rest a little, first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:50.18,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.02,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.26,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:01.52,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,We're lucky they were so dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.43,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:07.75,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,If they beat us there, we lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:08.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:11.19,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Why? It's a race, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:15.57,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'm sure Rentt has a reason, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:17.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So you figured it out, Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:23.44,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,You wanted to show us what a \Nboss fight looks like, first?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:26.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's part of it. But not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:29.92,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,My leg! My leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:43.44,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Those were guild employees, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. Even if you lose, you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:52.18,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:54.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:58.23,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's no shame for an adventurer \Nin avoiding a fight you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.60,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:05.57,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,But no, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:10.53,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,If I run away here, I don't \Nthink I'll ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:14.40,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I'll never be a real adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.11,0:21:17.27,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So... will you come with me, Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:24.22,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:27.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You've made your decision, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:31.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer who's been \Nbroken once becomes weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:38.88,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Once that happens, it's not rare at all for \Nadventurers to just quit the job entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:45.07,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ryze chose not to run because \Nhe sensed that instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:49.78,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's an important part of what \Nit takes to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:40.01,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(210.938,273.286)}Magical Contract
